request.description:
Approves many entries at once — **each one on its own**: a failure doesn't stop the others. Duplicate ids are ignored. Up to 200 ids.

Response lists what was approved and what failed with the reason:
```json
{
  "approved": [
    "dfbdf151-b195-4256-da2a-08df32e8cf98"
  ],
  "failed": [
    {
      "id": "c72f1b44-2b4b-4682-17d1-08df32eb3d3a",
      "reason": "This entry is not waiting for manager review. It is PendingDirector."
    },
    {
      "id": "5d0a5c33-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "reason": "Time entry not found."
    }
  ]
}
```

